"en": "Ascension XI"
}
description = "进阶十的一切，再加：只看得清 {intel_range} 步以内的敌人是谁，远处只知道是什么点；走近看过的一直看得清。在进阶十撤离一次后解锁。"
descriptions = {
"en": "Everything in Ascension X, and you only see who the enemies are within {intel_range} steps; farther spots show only what kind of spot they are. Once seen, they stay seen. Unlocked by extracting once on Ascension X."
}
